#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Plotting.rst:5 abb7a7d0a40941c586981537dd0b857b
msgid "MATLAB Real Time Plotting"
msgstr "MATLAB 实时绘图"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Plotting.rst:10 9cfd4c42b0534e15b919b6d0eb503f06
msgid ""
"The same high speed MATLAB UDP connection implemented for SITL can also be "
"used to stream data from ArduPilot to MATLAB. This allows real-time plotting"
" and calculations to be done in MATLAB. This is only a one-way link, data "
"cannot be passed back to ArduPilot. ArduPilot can be using any of its "
"`Simulation backends <https://youtu.be/YbOZWb8pddk>`__, including MATLAB or "
"Simulink provided they are running in a second MATLAB instance. This method "
"can be used to short-cut any analysis that would previously require a SITL "
"test flight and log analysis."
msgstr ""
"为 SITL 实现的同款高速 MATLAB UDP 连接也可用于将 ArduPilot 的数据流式传输到 MATLAB。这允许在 MATLAB "
"中进行实时绘图和计算。这是单向链路，数据无法回传给 ArduPilot。ArduPilot 可以使用其任意 `仿真后端 "
"<https://youtu.be/YbOZWb8pddk>`__，包括 MATLAB 或 Simulink（前提是它们运行在第二个 MATLAB "
"实例中）。此方法可以省去原本需要 SITL 测试飞行和日志分析的环节。"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Plotting.rst:16 e854d758efe5457e8a674dc189bb5372
msgid ""
"To avoid lag the data must be processed by MATLAB fast enough that the input"
" buffer remains empty. A common use case for such a tool is to prototype a "
"function. Once the function is working as expected in MATLAB it can be "
"manually translated in to C++ and run natively within ArduPilot. The c++ "
"result can then be included in the data streamed to MATLAB to be compared "
"with the prototype implementation."
msgstr ""
"为避免延迟，MATLAB 必须以足够快的速度处理数据，使输入缓冲区保持为空。此类工具的常见用途是对函数进行原型开发。一旦函数在 MATLAB "
"中按预期工作，即可手动将其翻译为 C++ 并在 ArduPilot 内原生运行。随后可将 C++ 结果包含在流式传输到 MATLAB "
"的数据中，以便与原型实现进行比较。"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Plotting.rst:21 3fbd7e2fafb94f24be5a3ebf957f2313
msgid ""
