#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Plotting.rst:34 77f124ed611f41ac93d233bd7df9fab4
msgid ""
"In the function of interest the data of is then assembled into a structure "
"and sent out over UDP. Note that the structure must be aligned, the simplest"
" way to achieve this is to used the same variable types. The IP and port "
"number should be set to match those used in MATLAB."
msgstr ""
"在目标函数中，数据随后被组装成结构体并通过 UDP 发出。请注意，结构体必须对齐，最简单的方法是使用相同的变量类型。IP 和端口号应设置为与 "
"MATLAB 中使用的相匹配。"

